    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Devoted of Ynnead",
    "summary": "Your army can include **YNNARI** units even without the **ASURYANI** Faction keyword.\n\nYour **ASURYANI** units, other than **EPIC HEROES**, get the **YNNARI** keyword.\n\nYour army must include **YVRAINE**, **THE YNCARNE** or both, and one of them must be your **WARLORD**.",
